# The roles of this routine, built by scripts/build-roles.sh into ../references/. Two kinds of line:
#   role <name> <reads> <part>[,<part>...]
#     builds references/<name>.md: a Rules block, then the parts (files under this folder, without .md), in order.
#     <reads> names the rule files the block tells the role to read, always and in full: comma-separated
#     names of skills/meridian/references/rules-<name>.list.
#   rule <file> <rule path>
#     copies one meridian rule to references/<file>, for an orchestrator that needs that rule alone.
#
# A part is a rule: one file per rule, in a folder per role (<role>/<rule>.md), the file named by the rule's
# title slug, in the format of core/write-every-rule-in-the-five-part-format.md; the part named head (the title,
# the read list, the preamble, and the case's parameters) is the one part that is not a rule, and the build
# leaves it unformat-checked.

role filler core,tests filler/head,filler/read-your-rows-the-row-script-and-the-kind,filler/decide-no-row-and-no-field,filler/fill-your-passs-null-fields,filler/take-the-expected-value-from-the-first-source-that-answers,filler/cite-a-file-with-a-quote-that-greps,filler/keep-a-value-to-the-outcome-it-expects,filler/treat-the-code-as-evidence-not-intent,filler/fill-shortfall-where-the-code-falls-short,filler/say-whether-the-row-can-happen,filler/write-a-question-only-where-no-source-answers,filler/write-empty-only-when-you-cannot-fill,filler/list-the-scripts-missed-rows-add-none,filler/run-the-parity-gate-before-you-report,filler/report-every-section-keyed-by-row-id,filler/say-what-you-did-not-read,filler/write-the-fill-file-with-your-file-tool-the-report-by-heredoc
role disprover core,tests disprover/head,disprover/disprove-every-claim-one-by-one,disprover/verify-every-citation-by-grepping-it,disprover/write-a-verdict-for-every-value-and-question,disprover/grade-only-the-ids-and-fields-the-fill-writes,disprover/grade-the-source-of-an-expected-value,disprover/confirm-a-canthappen-only-with-every-link-verified,disprover/search-for-a-source-before-agreeing-there-is-none,disprover/never-justify-a-value-that-rests-on-the-code,disprover/confirm-nothing-you-havent-read,disprover/list-everything-the-report-missed,disprover/list-what-a-row-script-misses-and-misreads,disprover/let-the-gate-keep-the-row-open,disprover/report-facts-with-grepped-citations,disprover/say-what-you-did-not-read-and-what-you-left-unchecked,disprover/save-the-report-by-heredoc-keyed-by-row-id
